{"abstract":[{"text":"Show fenced code blocks with the language ","type":"text"},{"code":"mermaid","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" as diagrams in attributed strings.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/DrawingMermaidDiagrams"},"kind":"article","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"MarkdownKit"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Drawing Mermaid Diagrams"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Fenced code blocks with the language ","type":"text"},{"code":"mermaid","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" are ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https://mermaid.js.org","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" diagrams. ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/HtmlGenerator","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" passes them on in a ","type":"text"},{"code":"<pre class=\"mermaid\">","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" element for web pages that load Mermaid. ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/AttributedStringGenerator","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" can draw them if it is created with the parameter ","type":"text"},{"code":"mermaid:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which takes a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidConfig","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" (the default is ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", in which case the diagram is shown as code):","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let generator = AttributedStringGenerator(mermaid: .default)   // or .dark for a dark background","let attributedStr = try await generator.generateAsync(doc: markdown)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Mermaid is a JavaScript library which needs the layout engine of a web browser to measure text. In contrast to syntax highlighting, which runs Highlight.js in JavaScriptCore, the diagrams are therefore drawn by ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidRenderer","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", which loads the ","type":"text"},{"code":"mermaid.min.js","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" that ships with MarkdownKit into a headless ","type":"text"},{"code":"WKWebView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and turns each diagram into a PNG image with transparent background (before macOS 14, the transparency is calculated from renderings on a white and on a black page, which takes about twice as long). Diagrams are only supported on macOS and iOS; on other platforms, and for diagrams which Mermaid rejects (the generator then adds the error message above the code), the code is shown.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Render-diagrams-before-generating-the-text","level":3,"text":"Render diagrams before generating the text","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Rendering takes time, so it is asynchronous:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"generateAsync","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" renders all diagrams of the document before it generates the attributed string.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"generate(doc:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" cannot wait for a web view; it shows the diagrams that have been rendered before, and code for the others. Call ","type":"text"},{"code":"await generator.prepareDiagrams(in: doc)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" first to render them (it returns ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" if it rendered anything, i.e. if ","type":"text"},{"code":"generate(doc:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" now gives a different result). Code that does not use Swift concurrency calls ","type":"text"},{"code":"generator.prepareDiagrams(in: doc) { rendered in … }","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" instead; like the completion handlers of ","type":"text"},{"code":"generateAsync","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the handler is called exactly once, asynchronously, on the main thread. There is no blocking variant: the web view that draws the diagrams needs the main thread, so waiting for it there would mean running the run loop inside the call.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MarkdownText","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"(_:mermaid:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" shows the code first and replaces it with the diagram once it is available. In dark mode it uses ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidConfig/darkVariant","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For a custom text view, prepare the diagrams, then generate the string synchronously:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let generator = AttributedStringGenerator(mermaid: .default)","generator.prepareDiagrams(in: markdown) { _ in","  textView.textStorage.setAttributedString(generator.generate(doc: markdown) ?? NSAttributedString())","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Configure-the-diagrams","level":3,"text":"Configure the diagrams","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidConfig","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" selects:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"the Mermaid ","type":"text"},{"code":"theme","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidConfig/Theme-swift.enum","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":": ","type":"text"},{"code":"default","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"neutral","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"dark","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"forest","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"base","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") and ","type":"text"},{"code":"themeVariables","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"the ","type":"text"},{"code":"fontFamily","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"the ","type":"text"},{"code":"scale","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (pixels per point, default 2) and the layout ","type":"text"},{"code":"width","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (default 800 points),","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"the ","type":"text"},{"code":"margin","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" around the diagram (default 8 points; Mermaid’s own, diagram-specific empty space around a diagram is removed, ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" keeps it),","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"a ","type":"text"},{"code":"maxWidth","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for the diagram in the attributed string,","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"the ","type":"text"},{"code":"spacing","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" between the diagram and the text above and below it (at least 16 points, like the margin between paragraphs), and","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"the ","type":"text"},{"code":"timeout","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" per diagram.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A diagram that is wider than the text view is scaled down to fit when the text is laid out. Diagrams are drawn on a transparent background, so use ","type":"text"},{"code":".dark","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (or ","type":"text"},{"code":"darkVariant","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") for text views with a dark background.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Use-the-renderer-on-its-own","level":3,"text":"Use the renderer on its own","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidRenderer","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" can also be used without a generator to get the PNG of a diagram:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["if let renderer = MermaidRenderer.shared {","  let image = try await renderer.render(\"graph LR\\n  A --> B\")","  try image.pngData.write(to: URL(fileURLWithPath: \"/tmp/diagram.png\"))","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"render(_:config:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" throws a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidError","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" if Mermaid rejects the diagram (","type":"text"},{"code":".syntaxError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), if rendering takes longer than the ","type":"text"},{"code":"timeout","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (","type":"text"},{"code":".timedOut","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), or if the platform has no WebKit (","type":"text"},{"code":".unsupportedPlatform","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"). ","type":"text"},{"code":"render(_:config:completionHandler:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is the variant for code that does not use Swift concurrency.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Understand-the-cache","level":3,"text":"Understand the cache","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Rendered diagrams, and the errors of diagrams which Mermaid rejected, are kept in memory by the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidRenderer","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidRenderer/shared","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" by default; pass ","type":"text"},{"code":"mermaidRenderer:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to the generator for another one), keyed by the diagram and the configuration (theme, theme variables, font family, scale and width). The cache holds at most 128 results and 64 MiB of images by default and drops the ones that were used least recently; ","type":"text"},{"code":"MermaidRenderer(mermaidJSURL:maxCachedDiagrams:maxCacheBytes:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" sets other limits.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"generateAsync","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" keeps the diagrams of the document it generates itself, so it shows all of them whatever the size of the cache. ","type":"text"},{"code":"generate(doc:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MarkdownText","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", which uses it, only show the diagrams that are in the cache: ","type":"text"},{"code":"maxCachedDiagrams","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" should be at least the number of diagrams in the largest document that you display in this way.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Know-how-the-web-view-is-isolated","level":3,"text":"Know how the web view is isolated","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The web view cannot access the network or local files and has no connection to the rest of the application, and Mermaid runs with ","type":"text"},{"code":"securityLevel: 'strict'","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". It is created when the first diagram is rendered and released after 60 seconds without requests; create the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidRenderer","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" with ","type":"text"},{"code":"idleTime:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to change that (","type":"text"},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" releases it as soon as no request is waiting, ","type":"text"},{"code":".infinity","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" never releases it).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Replace ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sources/MarkdownKit/Mermaid/mermaid.min.js","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to use another version of Mermaid; it has to be a build that defines the global ","type":"text"},{"code":"mermaid","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidRenderer","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" reads the 3.6 MB file once and keeps it in memory; create it with ","type":"text"},{"code":"cachesScript: false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (","type":"text"},{"code":"MermaidRenderer(mermaidJSURL:cachesScript:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") to read the file again whenever the web view is created instead.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit":{"abstract":[{"text":"Parse, process and display text in Markdown format.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","title":"MarkdownKit","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/markdownkit"},"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/AttributedStringGenerator":{"abstract":[{"code":"AttributedStringGenerator","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" provides functionality for converting Markdown blocks into","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSAttributedString","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" objects that are used in macOS and iOS for displaying rich text.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The implementation is extensible allowing subclasses of ","type":"text"},{"code":"AttributedStringGenerator","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"override how individual Markdown structures are converted into attributed strings.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AttributedStringGenerator"}],"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/AttributedStringGenerator","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AttributedStringGenerator"}],"role":"symbol","title":"AttributedStringGenerator","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/markdownkit/attributedstringgenerator"},"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/DisplayingMarkdownWithSwiftUI":{"abstract":[{"text":"Show a Markdown document in a SwiftUI view, and adapt it to light and dark mode.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/DisplayingMarkdownWithSwiftUI","kind":"article","role":"article","title":"Displaying Markdown with SwiftUI","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/markdownkit/displayingmarkdownwithswiftui"},"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/HtmlGenerator":{"abstract":[{"code":"HtmlGenerator","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" provides functionality for converting Markdown blocks into HTML. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"implementation is extensible allowing subclasses of ","type":"text"},{"code":"HtmlGenerator","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to override how","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"individual Markdown structures are converted into HTML.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"HtmlGenerator"}],"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/HtmlGenerator","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"HtmlGenerator"}],"role":"symbol","title":"HtmlGenerator","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/markdownkit/htmlgenerator"},"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MarkdownText":{"abstract":[{"text":"A SwiftUI view that displays a Markdown document as formatted text. The view converts the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"document into an attributed string with an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/AttributedStringGenerator","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", using different","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"generators for light and dark mode, and shows the result in a read-only text view whose text","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can be selected. The view scrolls vertically.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MarkdownText"}],"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MarkdownText","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MarkdownText"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MarkdownText","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/markdownkit/markdowntext"},"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidConfig":{"abstract":[{"text":"Configures how ","type":"text"},{"code":"MermaidRenderer","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" draws Mermaid diagrams, and how","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"AttributedStringGenerator","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" places them in an attributed string. Passing a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"MermaidConfig","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to the ","type":"text"},{"code":"mermaid:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" parameter of ","type":"text"},{"code":"AttributedStringGenerator.init","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" enables","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the rendering of fenced code blocks with the language ","type":"text"},{"code":"mermaid","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MermaidConfig"}],"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidConfig","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MermaidConfig"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MermaidConfig","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/markdownkit/mermaidconfig"},"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidConfig/Theme-swift.enum":{"abstract":[{"text":"The Mermaid themes.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Theme"}],"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidConfig/Theme-swift.enum","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Theme"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MermaidConfig.Theme","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/markdownkit/mermaidconfig/theme-swift.enum"},"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidConfig/darkVariant":{"abstract":[{"text":"The configuration to use for dark backgrounds if this one is meant for light backgrounds:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it uses the dark theme instead of ","type":"text"},{"code":".default","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":".neutral","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":".forest","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". A configuration","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which already uses ","type":"text"},{"code":".dark","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":".base","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (a theme for which the colors are set explicitly","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"via ","type":"text"},{"code":"themeVariables","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") is returned unchanged.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"darkVariant"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11MarkdownKit13MermaidConfigV","text":"MermaidConfig"}],"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidConfig/darkVariant","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"darkVariant","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/markdownkit/mermaidconfig/darkvariant"},"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidDiagramContext":{"abstract":[{"text":"Keeps track of the diagrams which an HTML generator has put into the HTML. The system’s HTML","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"importer cannot place images with a given size (it ignores the size attributes, and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"resolution of an image is interpreted differently on macOS and iOS), so the HTML contains a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"piece of text instead of an image. Once the HTML has been turned into an attributed string,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"replacePlaceholders(in:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" replaces each of these pieces of text with an ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSTextAttachment","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MermaidDiagramContext"}],"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidDiagramContext","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MermaidDiagramContext"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MermaidDiagramContext","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/markdownkit/mermaiddiagramcontext"},"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidError":{"abstract":[{"text":"Errors thrown by ","type":"text"},{"code":"MermaidRenderer","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MermaidError"}],"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidError","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MermaidError"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MermaidError","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/markdownkit/mermaiderror"},"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidImage":{"abstract":[{"text":"A rendered Mermaid diagram: a PNG image with transparent background.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MermaidImage"}],"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidImage","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MermaidImage"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MermaidImage","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/markdownkit/mermaidimage"},"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidRenderer":{"abstract":[{"text":"Turns ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https://mermaid.js.org","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" diagram descriptions into images.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MermaidRenderer"}],"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidRenderer","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MermaidRenderer"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MermaidRenderer","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/markdownkit/mermaidrenderer"},"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidRenderer/shared":{"abstract":[{"text":"The shared ","type":"text"},{"code":"MermaidRenderer","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", using the ","type":"text"},{"code":"mermaid.min.js","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" which ships with this package.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Returns ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" if that resource cannot be found, or if the platform does not support","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rendering diagrams (everything but macOS and iOS).","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"shared"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11MarkdownKit15MermaidRendererC","text":"MermaidRenderer"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidRenderer/shared","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"shared","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/markdownkit/mermaidrenderer/shared"},"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/RenderingUntrustedMarkdown":{"abstract":[{"text":"Restrict what raw HTML, links and images in a document may do when the Markdown does not come from you.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/RenderingUntrustedMarkdown","kind":"article","role":"article","title":"Rendering Untrusted Markdown","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/markdownkit/renderinguntrustedmarkdown"},"https://mermaid.js.org":{"identifier":"https://mermaid.js.org","title":"Mermaid","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"Mermaid","type":"text"}],"type":"link","url":"https://mermaid.js.org"}},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Related-Documentation","identifiers":["doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/RenderingUntrustedMarkdown","doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/DisplayingMarkdownWithSwiftUI"],"title":"Related Documentation"},{"anchor":"Drawing-Mermaid-diagrams","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidRenderer","doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidConfig","doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidImage","doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidError","doc://MarkdownKit/documentation/MarkdownKit/MermaidDiagramContext"],"title":"Drawing Mermaid diagrams"}],"variants":[{"paths":["/documentation/markdownkit/drawingmermaiddiagrams"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}]}